# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  f3d44bd wwe2k14 Session 70: the optimised SPIR-V store logs how many modules came from it
#  daea803 wwe2k14 Session 70: the optimised SPIR-V store (TITLE.spvopt) - the precompile (vulkan_spirv_optimize_collect) optimises the code not stored yet on a pool of threads and stores it; every run makes its modules from the stored code (vulkan_spirv_optimize_store, default on; exact: check_item s70_spirv_opt); the precompile waits for the optimiser and reports what it stored
#  daec775 wwe2k14 Session 70: the crowd cull judges the match crowd's shader too (0x183CC64A4C4E96AC, the lit entrance shader's position math); the lit shaders only while c255 is (0, 1)
#  9499935 wwe2k14 Session 70: the crowd cull logs each vertex shader it cannot judge once
#  8d22e4b wwe2k14 Session 70: gpu_scene_crowd_cull (1 count, 2 leave out) - the queued crowd members entirely outside the view of the draw taking their run (its own c56-c59, each member's c76-c78, the mesh box from its vertex buffer; the two known crowd vertex shaders, clipping on, a 1% margin); [scene][crowd] cull lines
