#  105645a wwe2k14 Session 70: the precompile takes gpu_native_pipeline_workers when set (a test of an 8-thread CPU)
#  53e0c36 wwe2k14 Session 70: gpu_native_precompile (the launcher's precompile: stored NATIVE pipelines made at once on a worker per CPU thread at normal priority, retries every 10 frames, progress in gpu_native_precompile_status)
#  953f381 wwe2k14 Session 70: an older NATIVE record's guessed variant is stored by the first draw that uses it, and an older record with a known sibling is not expanded (v0.2.8 prewarmed both epilogue variants every run, for good); pipeline workers below normal priority (gpu_native_pipeline_workers_quiet), normal while the command thread waits for one

